 "what": "bench/compare.cpp of f688794 with probe arms, built outside the tree against a copy of include/ of f688794. A suffix is a macro of the copy: +NOOWNER removes the moved-from check and the owner copy from accessor::at_path; +OWNEREQ makes validity::throw_logic_error_if_empty test owner.owner_equal(std::shared_ptr<void const>()) in place of use_count() == 0; +OWNERBEFORE makes it test !owner.owner_before(e) && !e.owner_before(owner) with e an empty std::shared_ptr<void const>. Arms on carsales and records: MB_FIELD, MB_FIELD_UNVERIFIED (+_AA, A/A), MB_READ, MB_READ_UNVERIFIED, each with the suffixes, FB_FIELD and FB_READ (FlatBuffers without its Verifier). One binary per arm and data set, 5 rounds, shuffled order, 1 s min_time.",
